WEBVTT

00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:05.970
It was an era when a man lived as a warrior...

00:00:06.110 --> 00:00:10.780
He fought, staking his life on
his faith in the sword...

00:00:10.880 --> 00:00:14.610
The final era... the Bakumatsu.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:29.000
Intrigue in the Bakumatsu

00:00:43.220 --> 00:00:46.850
On the land with the frozen moonlight

00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:50.690
It's rolling and drawing the line

00:00:50.690 --> 00:00:57.900
The era of destruction and rebirth now begins

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:01.570
Heavily holding the freedom

00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:05.170
Choosing the invisible path

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:12.240
Passing the sunset that's brighter than the daylight

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:19.250
The vessel of time moves on as if telling the dream

00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:28.350
There's a new dawn beyond the dark path

00:01:29.130 --> 00:01:36.270
We may have been born from the arm of darkness

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:39.810
Just like being in an impossible love

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:43.780
We wander into the light

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:49.050
The path stretches indefinitely

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:54.490
And there's no way to go back

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:07.060
I won't let you get away!

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.930
Village of Koma

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.020
This part isn't working correctly.

00:03:48.270 --> 00:03:49.460
Thank you for your hard work.

00:03:52.700 --> 00:03:55.700
Leader, what should we do now?

00:03:57.440 --> 00:03:58.700
Well...

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:00.870
I know...

00:04:01.080 --> 00:04:07.920
It took us ten years, but we
finally followed through with it.

00:04:07.920 --> 00:04:10.390
Frankly we no longer need to
perform or be in this town.

00:04:10.590 --> 00:04:14.080
I have no idea where Akizuki went, either.

00:04:17.900 --> 00:04:18.730
Where's Shiranui?

00:04:20.230 --> 00:04:24.030
Oh, he's gone there. Again.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.150
What a good-looking man you are!

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:37.270
Why don't you come see us?

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:44.690
What a great view!

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.130
Hello, handsome!

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:50.650
Handsome? You must be talking to me!

00:04:59.670 --> 00:05:05.130
Hello! What a good-looking fellow you are!
One customer is coming in!

00:05:58.730 --> 00:06:00.460
You've gotten better.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.900
Forgive my long absence.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:15.340
I figured you would be visiting me soon.

00:06:24.190 --> 00:06:26.560
I'm here to make a report to you, Shoten-sama.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:30.620
Lord Shoten of Koma

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:31.660
I'll listen to you while I eat.

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:33.460
Shinza, have it ready.

00:06:34.230 --> 00:06:36.330
Come, Yojiro.

00:06:53.080 --> 00:06:55.250
This is good.

00:06:59.360 --> 00:07:01.790
I guess this one is still uncooked.

00:07:02.790 --> 00:07:04.330
I'll cook it again.

00:07:04.330 --> 00:07:06.090
It's all right.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:09.030
So, what was it?

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:12.230
You did cut down the Head, but still...

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:17.140
However, the Moontear Sword says that
it was unable to eradicate its spirit.

00:07:17.440 --> 00:07:19.340
Do you understand that?

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.580
You couldn't cut this properly, huh?

00:07:29.920 --> 00:07:31.410
That's!

00:07:34.090 --> 00:07:38.150
No matter how much you sharpen
your blade or how skilled you are,

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.960
some things just can't be cut, huh?

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:42.830
Then...

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:45.340
What can he do?

00:07:46.770 --> 00:07:49.170
We don't know just yet...

00:07:49.840 --> 00:07:53.470
However, it is you who will figure out the answer.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:58.380
It's you, whose mission is to seal
the Head of the Conqueror.

00:08:01.650 --> 00:08:03.120
Thank you!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.990
Please come again!

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:07.290
I'll be back to see you again!

00:08:08.530 --> 00:08:11.860
And just when I warmed up...

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:19.030
Oh?

00:08:27.080 --> 00:08:29.100
So-sama, it's raining.

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:32.250
Damn...

00:08:32.250 --> 00:08:34.680
I hate to admit it, but they're picture-perfect.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.520
Hold it for a second.

00:09:16.590 --> 00:09:20.090
Master... Are you sure this is
going to be our new play?

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:23.360
That's right.

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:27.370
I know... I know our revenge is over.

00:09:27.370 --> 00:09:31.270
And there's no law that you can't
make a play out of it, either, but...

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:35.440
Actually nothing is over just yet, Leader.

00:09:36.450 --> 00:09:41.250
Now that I think about it, he hesitated
for just a second back then.

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:45.010
That could've been something!

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:46.790
Hey, what do you mean, something?

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.760
How should I know that?

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:53.260
There's a reverse side to everything.

00:09:53.600 --> 00:09:56.900
I don't blame you for not noticing...

00:09:58.240 --> 00:10:02.200
...but there was someone
who noticed the reverse side.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:04.030
That's a surprise.

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:05.730
So he noticed it...

00:10:06.280 --> 00:10:07.870
Akizuki-sama...

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:17.050
It is you who will figure out the answer.

00:10:17.460 --> 00:10:21.650
It's you, whose mission is to seal
the Head of the Conqueror.

00:10:31.140 --> 00:10:33.440
Come on, come all!

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:35.810
This is our second performance
here at the Ushioza.

00:10:35.810 --> 00:10:39.640
We're the Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe!

00:10:40.480 --> 00:10:46.520
Our highly-acclaimed "Japanese Kabuki -
The New Tale of Ryoma Sakamoto"

00:10:46.520 --> 00:10:49.110
will be followed by our new play!

00:10:49.390 --> 00:10:52.290
The setting is the western province,
the time is the Ansei Era.

00:10:52.290 --> 00:10:57.160
It's a story of a pathetic commoner
bombarded with governmental politics.

00:10:57.530 --> 00:11:00.870
There's a reverse side to everything.

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:04.600
I'm afraid to tell you it's the same way
with the politics of society.

00:11:04.740 --> 00:11:06.500
It's our new play!

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:09.100
"The reverse side of a bribery scandal.

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:13.610
"The Hidden Secret of
the Director of Palace Upkeep"!

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.100
Don't miss it!

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:18.420
Here you go! Take one!

00:11:33.530 --> 00:11:35.800
That man Hario...

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:42.640
I don't think he said anything at the end, but...

00:11:46.840 --> 00:11:49.540
If he did...

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:54.840
We'll just have to destroy that stupid play.

00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:07.020
There are two sides to everything.
This world is very interesting indeed.

00:12:29.890 --> 00:12:32.380
Aren't you the stud, Master?

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:35.520
Oh well, it only goes to show
that you're just a man just like me.

00:12:35.730 --> 00:12:37.030
You're up next, Shiranui!

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:37.930
All right!

00:12:55.280 --> 00:12:59.250
It's a good gun, but it tends
to drift slightly to the left.

00:12:59.250 --> 00:13:02.010
Let me get it adjusted for you right away.

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:12.750
Thank you!

00:13:28.510 --> 00:13:45.830
I want to sleep through the morning with you

00:13:47.330 --> 00:14:02.510
even if means killing three thousand
crows in the world

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:09.550
Takasugi... Ryoma...

00:14:09.550 --> 00:14:14.180
They both died way too soon...

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:19.090
We haven't seen you for a long time.

00:14:23.940 --> 00:14:26.870
You're such a cold person, Katsu-sensei.

00:14:27.970 --> 00:14:29.870
Don't call me "Sensei".

00:14:30.110 --> 00:14:32.910
Then, what about "Awanokami-sama"?

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:35.310
Now that you're in charge of
Military Affairs of Edo...

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:38.210
Congratulations on your promotion.

00:14:38.580 --> 00:14:42.780
What do I do with you, Tayu?
You're quick to hear things as always.

00:14:43.620 --> 00:14:45.150
Let's just have a drink.

00:14:45.390 --> 00:14:47.550
Yes. I'd love to.

00:14:54.570 --> 00:14:57.530
It's good. Now it's your turn.

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:10.710
So how's business in Yokohama?

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:14.450
Well, I don't know if it's good or bad.

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:18.790
Given the times we live in, I can't really tell.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:21.730
I wish it were simpler,

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:23.690
just like the relationship between
a man and a woman.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:27.860
Simple? The relationship between
a man and a woman?

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:31.260
Unless some scoundrel I know complicates it.

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:32.870
I guess you're right.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:43.110
English Foreign Minister stationed in Japan    H.S. Parkes

00:15:44.120 --> 00:15:46.280
Oh, there you are.

00:15:46.520 --> 00:15:47.750
Tayu, I'm sorry, but...

00:15:47.950 --> 00:15:53.390
Cartainly. I guess I'll go cheat on you.

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:54.930
I'm sorry.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:57.830
This is about the only place in Yokohama
where I can still have a secret meeting.

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:15.970
So, who is this guy?

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:17.650
A bodyguard.

00:16:17.820 --> 00:16:19.350
I see.

00:16:19.350 --> 00:16:24.310
Foreigners have been killed in Yokohama.
You can't be too careful, I guess.

00:16:24.490 --> 00:16:26.680
No. YOUR bodyguard.

00:16:26.990 --> 00:16:27.920
What?

00:16:32.330 --> 00:16:36.270
At that time, Katsu's arrival in Yokohama
was highly confidential.

00:16:36.700 --> 00:16:41.270
It was inevitable for him to have clandestine
negotiations with Kichinosuke Takamori Saigo,

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:44.540
Kichinosuke Takamori Saigo

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:45.530
the chief of staff of the Eastern Army, which had
been stuck in Sunbu due to the earlier earthquake


00:16:45.680 --> 00:16:52.010
and also have a talk with Parkes,
an important figure of the British Empire.

00:16:52.420 --> 00:16:56.680
More than anything, he needed
to discuss the fate of Yoshinobu,

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:59.350
under house arrest at Kanei Temple in Ueno,
and the fate of the Tokugawa family.

00:16:59.490 --> 00:17:04.360
Of course, if this meeting became known to the
Anti-Katsu members of the government,

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:07.690
his life would be in danger.

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:21.380
Come on, Kobako, Benimaru! Hurry up!

00:17:21.810 --> 00:17:22.710
Okay!

00:17:40.900 --> 00:17:42.390
How is it?

00:17:43.070 --> 00:17:44.870
Good job.

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:46.170
Thank you, Sir.

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.660
Well then...

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.550
Come one, come all!

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:38.580
Kakunojo Yuyama Troupe is here!

00:18:38.990 --> 00:18:49.270
We have a message for you in behalf of the most
famous one of the Sekkakuro, Tayu Kotoha!

00:18:49.270 --> 00:18:51.540
Our new play will be at the Ushioza, titled
"The reverse side of a bribery scandal.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:55.230
"The Hidden Secret of the
Director of Palace Upkeep!"

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:57.040
"The reverse side of a bribery scandal.

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:59.440
The Hidden Secret of the
Director of Palace Upkeep!"

00:18:59.640 --> 00:19:02.910
Tomorrow is opening day!

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:06.020
I see. That's what it was all about.

00:19:06.020 --> 00:19:08.780
Now I know why the Master
was with Tayu Kotoha.

00:19:14.690 --> 00:19:18.530
I expect nothing less from someone
as popular as Kiyu from Gankiro.

00:19:18.730 --> 00:19:22.700
I've heard that her customers are pretty powerful
people. Who's she favored the most by?

00:19:22.700 --> 00:19:24.460
Satsuma? Choshu?

00:19:24.700 --> 00:19:27.570
I've heard rumor that it's actually Joiya from Mito.

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:31.130
No, I've actually heard it's an Englishman!

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:32.830
Wow, a foreigner, too?

00:19:32.980 --> 00:19:34.810
I understand that she has to take care
of every customer, but still...

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:36.940
What the heck is she thinking?

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:41.810
Hey, Tayu Kotoha! You're the best in Japan!

00:19:42.350 --> 00:19:43.820
Tayu Kotoha!

00:19:43.820 --> 00:19:44.810
The best in Japan!

00:19:52.230 --> 00:19:54.860
The Reverse Side of a Bribery Scandal, is it?

00:20:00.400 --> 00:20:01.300
Go inside!

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:02.870
What's wrong?

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:03.500
A sniper!

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:37.200
Did something just happen?

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:43.680
Akizuki-sama!

00:20:43.680 --> 00:20:44.880
So that means!

00:20:45.280 --> 00:20:46.040
Over there!

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:47.580
That's him!

00:20:47.580 --> 00:20:48.570
I won't let him get away!

00:20:50.350 --> 00:20:51.380
After him!

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:52.490
All right!

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:05.860
Tayu Kotoha!

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:07.670
The best in Japan!

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:12.410
He's in Yokohama!

00:21:58.390 --> 00:22:02.350
<i>BALLAD OF</i>
<i>STONE CRANE MANSION</i>

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:09.330
The hand is the sword of love

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:18.370
It proves the beginning of all

00:22:19.140 --> 00:22:25.100
Beyond the sparkling sky

00:22:25.550 --> 00:22:30.320
The dream is still an illusion

00:22:31.460 --> 00:22:34.560
Running on the path

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:42.070
Just like chasing the shadow of the moonlight

00:22:42.070 --> 00:22:47.840
The torn sword of love

00:22:47.840 --> 00:23:00.080
At the end of it thousands of teardrops become one

00:23:00.080 --> 00:23:05.890
And brighten tomorrow

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:11.600
This hand is the sword of love

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:20.300
It proves the beginning of all

00:23:32.890 --> 00:23:48.630
<i>EPISODE 4
ANECDOTE OF AN
UNDERHANDED SCANDAL</i>

00:23:33.780 --> 00:23:34.280
I think you've gone too far with that
cute face of yours, Kakunojo Yuyama!

00:23:34.280 --> 00:23:39.360
I think you've gone too far with that
cute face of yours, Kakunojo Yuyama!

00:23:39.490 --> 00:23:45.730
But allowing you to go any further
would cause me some serious trouble.

00:23:45.930 --> 00:23:48.630
You know, when you think it's
too good to be true, it probably is.

00:23:48.630 --> 00:24:02.580
<i>ANECDOTE OF AN
UNDERHANDED SCANDAL</i>

00:23:48.630 --> 00:23:49.100
You know, when you think it's
too good to be true, it probably is.

00:23:49.100 --> 00:23:53.540
Now I'm going to make you regret this!

00:23:53.540 --> 00:23:57.140
You'll wish you kept your play
as simply a play for fun!
